{"id":512,"date":"2022-09-12T12:01:03","date_gmt":"2022-09-12T02:31:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/?p=512"},"modified":"2022-09-14T10:22:11","modified_gmt":"2022-09-14T00:52:11","slug":"product-data-export-from-feedops","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-data-export-from-feedops\/","title":{"rendered":"Product Data Export from FeedOps"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"512\" class=\"elementor elementor-512\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0514554 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0514554\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-710eb55\" data-id=\"710eb55\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-08421e6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"08421e6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">New Feature: Export to Google Sheet<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05564c0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"05564c0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>FeedOps is dedicated to helping you get your product data where it needs to go, in the format it needs to be.<\/p><p>Today we have released a new feature that allows you to export a view of your product data to a Google Sheet, giving you more flexibility than ever before in how you access your data.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-34936ef\" data-id=\"34936ef\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b690b09 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b690b09\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"445\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.33.10-am-1024x570.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-514\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.33.10-am-1024x570.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.33.10-am-300x167.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.33.10-am-768x428.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.33.10-am.png 1149w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-54acd07 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"54acd07\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-86ac016\" data-id=\"86ac016\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd1d815 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"fd1d815\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">How to Export your Product Data<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0ce9926 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0ce9926\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Exporting your product data is as easy.<\/p><p>1. Go to Channel &gt; Products<\/p><p>2. Apply any filters you would like to<\/p><p>3. Select any columns you want included in the export<\/p><p>4. Click the &#8220;Export&#8221; button<\/p><p>In a couple of minutes you will see a new tab open in your browser showing the Google Sheet with your exported data.<\/p><p>Please note, if you have your browser configured to block popups your export sheet may not appear automatically. You can either enable popups for app.feedops.com, or manually click on the link the success message.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-99dcaf3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"99dcaf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"86\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.46.17-am-1024x110.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-516\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.46.17-am-1024x110.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.46.17-am-300x32.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.46.17-am-768x82.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.46.17-am.png 1186w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">If the popup is blocked, you can manually access your export by clicking the link in your success message.<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e3deb7c elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e3deb7c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"159\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.47.19-am-1024x203.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-515\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.47.19-am-1024x203.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.47.19-am-300x60.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.47.19-am-768x153.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-12-at-11.47.19-am.png 1198w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Some browsers (e.g. Chrome) allow you to disable popup blocking for individual sites.<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c7f596b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c7f596b\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-d758204\" data-id=\"d758204\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b40480e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"b40480e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Some Examples<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f058bca elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"f058bca\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>This feature opens up a range of new opportunities for you in understanding and sharing your product data. Here are some simple examples:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>List products that have been recently added or edited<\/li><li>Cross check custom labels against internal systems<\/li><li>Produce a list of image URLs and focus keywords related to a product or product category<\/li><li>&#8230; and many more.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cfb9ac4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"cfb9ac4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Other changes<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6a1e262 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6a1e262\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>One other minor change with this release is that you enable and disable categories in a new location. To enable a new category, go to Website &gt; Connect, and click Select Website Categories.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bae82f5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"bae82f5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"314\" src=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-1024x402.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-518\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-1024x402.png 1024w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-300x118.png 300w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-768x301.png 768w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-1536x603.png 1536w, https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Screen-Shot-2022-09-14-at-9.42.43-am-2048x803.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>FeedOps helps you get your product data where it needs to be. Our new export to Google Sheet feature gives you even more flexibility.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":513,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"content-type":"","footnotes":""},"categories":[1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-512","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-uncategorized"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v26.6 (Yoast SEO v26.6) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Product Data Export from FeedOps<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-data-export-from-feedops\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Product Data Export from FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"FeedOps helps you get your product data where it needs to be. Our new export to Google Sheet feature gives you even more flexibility.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/product-data-export-from-feedops\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"FeedOps\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:publisher\" content=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/feedops\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2022-09-12T02:31:03+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2022-09-14T00:52:11+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/feedops.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/pexels-ketut-subiyanto-4246118-scaled.jpg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"2560\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"1707\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"Tim Campbell\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"Tim Campbell\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"t